# CR-102 regression vectors: encoder edge cases touched by the CR-102 refactoring
# (shared tag-header writer, shared minimal-length integer writer, integer NaN test).
# Expected results were produced by the pre-CR-102 implementation; CR-102 must not
# change any of them. Run: python3 run_vectors.py acceptance.vec cr102.vec
### real-nan-refused
# E5a: every NaN (quiet, signalling, negative, max payload) -> ERR
enc_real 7fc00000
enc_real 7f800001
enc_real ffc00000
enc_real ff800001
enc_real 7fffffff
enc_real ffffffff
---
ERR
ERR
ERR
ERR
ERR
ERR
### real-special-values
# E5: +/-Inf, -0.0, subnormal, max finite are encoded bit-exact
enc_real 7f800000
enc_real ff800000
enc_real 80000000
enc_real 00000001
enc_real 7f7fffff
enc_real 807fffff
---
OK 447f800000
OK 44ff800000
OK 4480000000
OK 4400000001
OK 447f7fffff
OK 44807fffff
